        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this charming three-bedroom, two-bathroom terraced home to the market at 14 Lissadel Avenue, Drimnagh, Dublin 12. Ideally positioned on a quiet and mature residential street, this property offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families, or investors seeking a spacious home with fantastic potential in a well-established community.\nDrimnagh is a long-established and highly regarded suburb, known for its strong sense of community and exceptional convenience. Residents benefit from a wide range of local amenities within walking distance, including shops, cafés, schools, parks, and sporting facilities. The area is very well serviced by public transport, with the Red Line LUAS nearby providing quick and easy access to Dublin City Centre. In addition, major road networks such as the M50 and N7 are easily accessible, making commuting straightforward. Popular amenities including Sundrive Shopping Centre, Ashleaf Shopping Centre, and a variety of reputable primary and secondary schools are all close at hand.\nNo. 14 offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, extending to approximately 92 sqm of internal floorspace. The layout is ideal for modern family living, with ample potential for further enhancement. Internal accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, reception room, dining area, and a kitchen overlooking the rear garden, a downstairs wc completes the ground floor. Upstairs hosts three generous and well-proportioned bedrooms along with the main family bathroom.\nExternally, the property benefits from a well-maintained front garden and a large, sunny rear garden—perfect for relaxing, gardening, or entertaining. The home also enjoys the advantages of a terrace positioning, including additional side access and increased privacy.\nNo. 14 Lissadel Avenue comes to the market vacant with no onward chain, ensuring a smooth and straightforward purchase process. While in good condition, it offers an ideal blank canvas for buyers to put their own stamp on a home in a superb location.\nEarly viewing is highly advised to fully appreciate the space, setting, and potential this wonderful property has to offer. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS.\nFeatures\n• 3-bed / 2 bath terraced home\n• Approx. 92 sqm of internal floorspace\n• BER C3\n• Quiet and sought-after residential street\n• Bright and spacious interior\n• Large sunny rear garden\n• Additional side access\n• Ideal blank canvas for owner-occupiers\n• Mature and established area\n• Excellent public transport and road networks\n• Close to schools, shops, parks, and amenities\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, families or investors\n• Vacant with no onward chain\n• Early viewing highly advised\nDirections\nEircode D12 T958\n"
      },
